      <p>If the club night is your job, <a href="/guides/best-badminton-club-night-software">how to choose badminton club software for your club night</a> sets out what matters, and <a href="/compare">the comparison of 32 club-night products</a> has the scores, the limitations and the rubric behind them.</p>

      <p>If it is the money, <a href="/guides/setting-club-subs">setting club subs</a> covers what to charge and <a href="/guides/collecting-club-subs">collecting club subs</a> covers getting paid. If it is the running of the club itself, start with <a href="/guides/badminton-club-committee-roles">which committee roles a club has to fill</a>, <a href="/guides/badminton-club-constitution">writing a club constitution</a> and <a href="/guides/badminton-club-insurance">what club insurance covers</a>. Starting from nothing? <a href="/guides/how-to-start-a-badminton-club">How to start a badminton club</a> puts all of it in order.</p>

